      "name": "FedRAMP Package Contact",
      "icon": null,
      "description": "One row per contact listed on a FedRAMP Certification Package Overview -- pairs with fedramp-certification-package.rain. That schema requires at least one Security contact and one Sales contact per package; RAIN has no way to enforce that across rows, so treat it as a convention to follow when filling this register in, not something imports/validates for you. Each Asset's own \"Name\" field is the contact's name or role title.",
      "is_active": true,
      "sort_order": 0
    }
  ],
